p>", "labelEditorState": null}], "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{\"text\":[\"equal\",\"active\",\"false\",\"captive\",\"legal\",\"pure\",\"terror\",\"note\",\"glory\",\"central\",\"advert\",\"fossil\",\"liquid\",\"hospital\",\"scandal\",\"pressure\",\"computer\",\"simple\",\"glamour\",\"horror\",\"popular\",\"motive\"]}", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 44215424, "text": "Spotted something strange?", "modal": {"steps": [{"id": 44063169, "text": "Well done! Some words change more of their ending when you add a particular suffix. This happens because different words were introduced into the English language at different times and from different places.\n<br></br>\nHere is an example:\n<br></br>\n<b>Popular: Populate and popularise</b>\n<ul>\n<li>The word 'populate' came to English directly from the Latin word 'populatus', which meant 'fill with people'.</li>\n<li>The word 'popularise' is a newer word in English, so the root word 'popular' was already commonly used before the suffix 'ise' was added.</li>\n</ul>\n<br></br>\nOther examples you might have spotted during this activity:\n<ul>\n<li>equal + ate = equate</li>\n<li>liquid + ify = liquify</li>\n<li>terror + ify = terrify</li>\n<li>horror + ify = horrify</li>\n</ul>", "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 110, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 110, "name": "Spotted something strange?", "logCreatedAt": "2021-11-29T14:34:57.33251", "logUpdatedAt": "2021-11-29T16:38:17.601074", "logCreatedById": null, "logUpdatedById": null, "nameForContentDev": null}}, "order": 7, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 44065615, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 110, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 44065741, "text": "<h2>You will Need:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Paper;</li>\n<li>Something to write with.</li>\n</ul>\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 44065615, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 44205010, "text": "Spelling Rule List", "modal": {"steps": [{"id": 44204977, "text": "Spelling rules for adding suffixes (-ate -ise -ify):\n<br></br>\n<ul>\n<li>For words ending ‘y’, change the ‘y’ to ‘i’ then add the suffix.</li>\n<li>For words ending ‘e’, remove the ‘e’ then add the suffix.</li>\n<li>For words ending with a short vowel sound then a single consonant, double the consonant then add the suffix.</li>\n<li>For other word endings, leave the root word as it is then add the suffix.</li>\n</ul>\n<br></br>\nSometimes, more of the root word ending will change, e.g. popular + ate = populate.", "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 112, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 112, "name": "Spelling Rule List", "logCreatedAt": "2021-11-29T15:36:53.178459", "logUpdatedAt": "2021-11-29T15:36:53.178459", "logCreatedById": null, "logUpdatedById": null, "nameForContentDev": null}}, "order": 5, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 44065615, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 112, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 44204007, "text": "liquid + ise = liquidise. Picture of a blender.", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": "1638199535133_1image1-01FNP4S16HEDT6DBJHHGZ6W8P7.png", "linkName": null, "stepType": "IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 44065615, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 44204483, "text": "<h2>What to Do:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Look at the word in the orange box below.</li>\n<li>Decide which suffix you can add (-ate -ise -ify) to make a real verb.</li>\n<li>Write the verb you made. Think carefully about the spelling rules you know!</li>\n<li>Scroll across the orange box for your next word. Try five, then use the spelling rule list to check to see how many you got right.</li>\n<li>If you made any mistakes, write the correct spelling next to the mistake. If you didn’t, move onto the extra challenge.</li>\n<li>After you’ve checked, try another five to see if you can improve on your score.</li>\n</ol>\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 44065615, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 44205099, "text": "<h2>Extra Challenge:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Instead of looking at the root word, get your grownup to read it to you so you have to think about that spelling as well as adding the suffix. </li>\n<li>Try five!</li>\n<li>Then check by looking back through the words in the orange box and the spelling rule checklist.</li>\n</ul>\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 6, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMA